  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "First, store m and n.",
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 2080,
      "start_frame": 0,
      "end_frame": 62,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "Then create raw zero with m false values and create call zero with n false values.",
      "start_ms": 2440,
      "end_ms": 8400,
      "start_frame": 73,
      "end_frame": 252,
      "word_count": 16
    },
    {
      "text": "The first pass is only for discovery.",
      "start_ms": 9000,
      "end_ms": 11100,
      "start_frame": 270,
      "end_frame": 333,
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "For every cell, if matrix is zero, set row zero to true and call zeros to true.",
      "start_ms": 11640,
      "end_ms": 18800,
      "start_frame": 349,
      "end_frame": 564,
      "word_count": 17
    },
    {
      "text": "Notice the important part.",
      "start_ms": 19500,
      "end_ms": 20820,
      "start_frame": 585,
      "end_frame": 625,
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "During this pass, we are not changing the matrix.",
      "start_ms": 21700,
      "end_ms": 25320,
      "start_frame": 651,
      "end_frame": 760,
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "We are only recording information.",
      "start_ms": 25680,
      "end_ms": 27960,
      "start_frame": 770,
      "end_frame": 839,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "After discovery is complete, start the second pass.",
      "start_ms": 28760,
      "end_ms": 32180,
      "start_frame": 863,
      "end_frame": 965,
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "For every cell, check its row marker and its column marker.",
      "start_ms": 32740,
      "end_ms": 37100,
      "start_frame": 982,
      "end_frame": 1113,
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "If either one is true, set that matrix cell to zero.",
      "start_ms": 37680,
      "end_ms": 42060,
      "start_frame": 1130,
      "end_frame": 1262,
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "That is all.",
      "start_ms": 42560,
      "end_ms": 43400,
      "start_frame": 1277,
      "end_frame": 1302,
      "word_count": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "The code directly follows the invariant.",
      "start_ms": 44000,
      "end_ms": 46660,
      "start_frame": 1320,
      "end_frame": 1400,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "First, remember, then mutate.",
      "start_ms": 46940,
      "end_ms": 49720,
      "start_frame": 1408,
      "end_frame": 1492,
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "The time is already linear in the number of matrix cells, but the extra memory is still proportional to the number of rows plus columns.",
      "start_ms": 50140,
      "end_ms": 59880,
      "start_frame": 1504,
      "end_frame": 1796,
      "word_count": 25
    },
    {
      "text": "Can we remove even those two marker arrays?",
      "start_ms": 61140,
      "end_ms": 64420,
      "start_frame": 1834,
      "end_frame": 1933,
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "Look carefully at the matrix itself.",
      "start_ms": 65100,
      "end_ms": 67620,
      "start_frame": 1953,
      "end_frame": 2029,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "It already contains storage in exactly those two dimensions.",
      "start_ms": 68540,
      "end_ms": 72920,
      "start_frame": 2056,
      "end_frame": 2188,
      "word_count": 9
    }
  ],
